      "answer": "PORTFOLIO AI\n\nBased on the portfolio, the strongest featured projects include:\n\nJobPilot AI\n\nMahmoud's primary final project at The Digital Hub by UNRWA. It is an AI-assisted career workspace that connects job discovery with verified resume uploads, profile generation, job-fit analysis, and interview preparation.\n\nStack: Next.js, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Supabase, and OpenAI API.\nLobby\n\nA real-time communication platform supporting persistent communities and temporary guest rooms with live voice and screen sharing.\n\nStack: Angular, NestJS, Supabase, and LiveKit Cloud.\nConstruction Project Management & Accounting System\n\nA modular business platform unifying construction operations, procurement, inventory, and financial workflows.\n\nStack: Python, Django, PostgreSQL, and Docker.",
